<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not enough for test - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not enough for test - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Live basis: compared with Wednesday's close, steers and heifers were not tested, USDA said. Carcass basis: steers and heifers not well tested. Steers: Choice 2-4 1250 lbs ld old Crop 105.00 Reported sales for Thursday: 100 Week to Date: 28,800</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
